# Build-context override for Dockerfile in this directory (see its header
# comment). The repo-root .dockerignore excludes `tests/` wholesale for
# the deploy/ images, which don't need it; this image does. Pass this file
# as --ignorefile so THIS build gets its own (much smaller) exclusion list
# instead of the repo-root one.
.git
**/bin
**/obj
**/*.user
